    "text": "To find out how much Mishka spent on all the clothing items, we need to calculate the total cost for each type of clothing and then add them together.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Cost of shorts  \nMishka bought **3 pairs of shorts**, and each pair costs **$16.50**.\n\n$$\n3 \\times 16.50 = 49.50\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Cost of pants  \nMishka bought **3 pairs of pants**, and each pair costs **$22.50**.\n\n$$\n3 \\times 22.50 = 67.50\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Cost of shoes  \nMishka bought **3 pairs of shoes**, and each pair costs **$42**.\n\n$$\n3 \\times 42 = 126\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Total cost  \nNow, add up the costs of all the clothing items:\n\n$$\n49.50 + 67.50 + 126 = 243\n$$\n\n---\n\n#### <answer>\n243",
